; The one variable: the relay and its target sit in an instanced scene. The host instances
; unit-remote-transform-2d.tscn, whose RemoteTransform2D pushes its transform onto the pentagon, so
; the pentagon must stand where it does in that scene. No other scene moves a target inside an
; instance, so no other golden shows a regression in it.

